  "summary": {
    "derivative_id": "der:rc4:cb_e9374c2647e740729e64d7b3f0c7be30:summary",
    "text": "South Australian Rainbow Advocacy Alliance Inc. (SARAA) is a South Australia\u2011based peak body that advocates for LGBTIQA+ people across the state. As of the cited sources it runs policy advocacy and submissions (for example on births, deaths and marriages regulations), correspondence with health authorities about gender\u2011affirming care, and public events and commemorations such as Trans Day of Visibility and youth forums. SARAA provides online resources including a \u201cKnow Your Rights\u201d guide, operates a Rainbow Local Council Project to support local government inclusion, and recruits members and sells branded merchandise. Recent activity listed on the organisation\u2019s site includes submissions, letters to government, event listings and involvement in demographic question reviews for the state Department of Health and Wellbeing."
  },
